  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently the \"Animator Play Audio\" State Behaviour does not work in Editor.\n\nWhen I was trying to set it up on my Avatar I could not get it to work in Editor, even though it was working perfectly fine in client. (I wasted 2h trying to get it to work...)\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe \"Animator Play Audio\" State Behaviour should also work in Editor to:\n\n1. not confuse users when they are trying out their Avatar in Editor\n\n2. be consistent with other State Behaviours that **do** work in Editor\n\n3. make it easier to test Avatars without uploading them",
